                                "example_id": "76896f77-c80c-46ed-be73-3849c4689005",
                                "sense_id": "f02d56b2-c033-31de-8648-b4365c7fc73c",
                                "text": "Suppose Thorndike and Williams, citizens of the country of Freedonia, become embroiled in a dispute as to whether Freedonia ought to attack the country of Sylvania."
